    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Occupying a wonderfully tranquil setting in Gortdromakiery, Muckross, this substantial six-bedroom detached residence combines generous family accommodation with the privacy and natural beauty of country living—all within easy reach of Killarney town.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 278.5 m² and standing on a site of circa one acre (measurement to be confirmed), the property offers an impressive sense of space both inside and out. Its thoughtfully proportioned layout provides flexibility for a growing family, visiting guests, multigenerational living or those seeking dedicated space to work from home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes six spacious bedrooms, two of which enjoy private en-suite facilities. Two further family bathrooms are fitted with luxurious Jacuzzi baths, bringing the total to four bathrooms and ensuring excellent convenience throughout this sizeable home.\r\n\r\nThe main living areas are bright, airy and exceptionally well appointed. A particularly charming feature is the open fireplace in the living room, framed by beautiful floor-to-ceiling stonework and creating a warm, inviting focal point. Hardwood flooring and elegant porcelain tiling feature throughout, adding quality, character and practicality to the interior.\r\n\r\nWith a C1 BER rating, the residence offers an appealing combination of scale, comfort and energy efficiency. Large windows draw natural light into the home, while the generous room sizes create an effortless sense of openness.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property is surrounded by peaceful countryside and enjoys a wonderfully private atmosphere. The gentle sound of a stream in the distance and neighbouring sheep contribute to the calm, rural character of this special setting.\r\n\r\nThe location offers the best of both worlds: a quiet retreat from the bustle of everyday life, yet within comfortable driving distance of Killarney’s excellent schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, sporting clubs and recreational facilities. Lough Guitane National School is nearby, while Muckross, Killarney National Park, its famous lakes and beautiful woodland trails are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nSpacious, welcoming and beautifully presented, this exceptional Muckross residence offers an enviable lifestyle in one of County Kerry’s most naturally beautiful locations—a remarkable family home with room to live, grow and create lasting memories."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "1. Substantial six-bedroom detached family residence\r\n2. Impressive accommodation extending to approximately 278.5 m²\r\n3. Two generously sized bedrooms with private en-suite facilities\r\n4. Two additional family bathrooms featuring luxurious Jacuzzi baths\r\n5. Set on a private site of circa one acre (measurement to be confirmed)\r\n6. Energy-efficient C1 BER rating\r\n7. Beautiful hardwood flooring and porcelain tiling throughout\r\n8. Cosy open fireplace with striking floor-to-ceiling stonework\r\n9. Bright, spacious and exceptionally well-proportioned living accommodation\r\n10. Peaceful Muckross countryside setting within easy driving distance of Killarney town, schools, amenities and Killarney National Park"
      },
